OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome clear
OL,6,Fspells in the east tonight, but
OL,7,Fcloudier in the west where scattered
OL,8,Fshowers will continue. Strong winds
OL,9,Fwill ease through the evening, but it
OL,10,Fwill remain gusty around any showers.
OL,11,FRain arriving in the far west around
OL,12,Fdawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FAnother wet and windy day as
OL,15,FStorm Boelo pushes in from the west.
OL,16,FWidespread heavy rain and disruptive
OL,17,Fwinds, these reaching gale force along
OL,18,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
