OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA
OL,6,Fdrier, brighter day on Sunday although
OL,7,Fremaining windy until evening. Rain
OL,8,Fand very strong winds through Monday.
OL,9,FStrong winds and showers on Tuesday.
